r.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":5,"text":"Etancelin passes Chiron, who has trouble with his new hydraulic brakes; Brivio passes him too. Fagioli leads Caracciola by 3.6 seconds.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":6,"text":"Fagioli laps in 1m58.6s and is five seconds clear of Caracciola, half a minute ahead of Dreyfus.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Fagioli laps Howe. Zehender stops 3\u00bd minutes to adjust his brakes and drops to last.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":14,"text":"On the 14th lap Nuvolari went past his team mate Dreyfus, but Dreyfus managed to re-pass a few laps later.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":17,"text":"Fagioli laps in 1m58.4s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":19,"text":"Nuvolari's front brake locks in every corner; Etancelin passes him for fourth.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":20,"text":"At 20 laps Fagioli was leading Caracciola by 10.6 seconds and 40 seconds further behind was the trio of Dreyfus, Etancelin and Nuvolari.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Farina retires with fuel feed trouble.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":25,"text":"Etancelin takes third from Dreyfus and starts closing on Caracciola.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":36,"text":"On lap 36 Howe, running ninth, locked his brakes in the chicane, ended up in the sand bag barrier and retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":39,"text":"Nuvolari, his brakes failing, pits and hands over to reserve Trossi.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":40,"text":"Etancelin is 13.7 seconds behind Caracciola.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":46,"text":"Etancelin closes to five seconds of Caracciola.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":49,"text":"To the crowd's cheers Etancelin dives inside the Mercedes at the Gasometre and takes second.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":53,"text":"Trossi finally retired the brakeless Alfa Romeo on the 53rd lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":56,"text":"Etancelin's brakes fade and Caracciola re-passes him on the climb to the Casino.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":63,"text":"On lap 63 Fagioli made a 25 seconds stop for fuel, losing about a minute in total but returning to the race still well in the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":65,"text":"Caracciola pits with steam from the bonnet and retires with a broken valve; Villapadierna crashes into the sandbags at the chicane.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":70,"text":"At 70 laps Fagioli held a 40 seconds lead over Dreyfus with Brivio closing in on Etancelin. All the other competitors had been lapped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":73,"text":"Brivio passes Etancelin, who now also has oil pressure trouble.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":91,"text":"Etancelin was lapped by Fagioli on lap 91 leaving just the Mercedes and the two non-independent suspension Ferrari Alfas on the lead lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":97,"text":"Chiron stops in front of the grandstand short of fuel, to whistles from the crowd; Marinoni gets him going again.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":100,"text":"In the end Fagioli took the flag 31.5 seconds ahead of Dreyfus with Brivio finishing third over a minute behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}